---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Capabilities | ARCBRIM BUILDERS" current="capabilities">
  <section class="section">
    <h1>Capabilities</h1>
    <p class="muted">Arcbrim Builders engages in work where discipline and detail matter. Specifics are established after evaluation.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Scope Overview</h2>
    <p>Typical scope includes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Residential construction</li>
      <li>Specialty builds</li>
      <li>Detail-driven and technically complex projects</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Specifics are established after evaluation.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>What We Decline</h2>
    <p>Arcbrim Builders does not engage in:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Low-bid competitions</li>
      <li>Undefined or evolving scopes</li>
      <li>Projects without decision authority</li>
      <li>Compressed timelines without tradeoffs</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Declining misaligned work is intentional.</p>

    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href="/inquiry">Begin an inquiry</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
